<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>By nature and by practice far,</l><l>How very far from God;</l><l>Yet now by grace brought nigh to Him,</l><l>Through faith in Jesus’ blood.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>So nigh, so very nigh to God,</l><l>I cannot nearer be;</l><l>For in the person of His Son</l><l>I am as near as He.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>So dear, so very dear to God,</l><l>More dear I cannot be;</l><l>The love wherewith He loves the Son,</l><l>Such is His love to me.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Why should I ever anxious be,</l><l>Since such a God is mine?</l><l>He watches o’er me night and day,</l><l>And tells me “Mine is thine.”</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
